Here's a suggestion for a new character class:

Shapeshifter:

- has the ability to polymorph at will into any monster of equal or lower
  level (#shapeshift)
- starts with high constitution (low chance of system shock)
- each shapeshift costs power (or food or both)
- shapeshifts do not wear off -- they last until the next shapeshift
  (or other polymorph)
- hit points do not change as a result of shapeshifting

Opinions?
